WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.677 --> 00:00:20.101
Hello!

2
00:00:20.102 --> 00:00:24.239
Who are you?

3
00:00:24.239 --> 00:00:28.440
I'm a humpback whale.

4
00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:34.559
We are large sea mammals.

5
00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.976
Where do you live?

6
00:00:36.975 --> 00:00:41.541
Humpback whales live in the ocean.

7
00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:47.536
We travel very far every year.

8
00:00:47.536 --> 00:00:50.258
Where do you travel?

9
00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:55.829
We live in cold water in the summer.

10
00:00:55.829 --> 00:01:02.128
We swim to warm water for the winter.

11
00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:04.795
What do you eat?

12
00:01:04.795 --> 00:01:10.408
We eat small sea creatures and fish.

13
00:01:10.408 --> 00:01:28.726
Humpback whales are good hunters.

14
00:01:28.726 --> 00:01:33.785
I hear a song!

15
00:01:33.785 --> 00:01:38.778
Humpback whales make lots of sounds.

16
00:01:38.778 --> 00:01:43.863
Males even sing songs.

17
00:01:43.863 --> 00:01:53.478
Sometimes they sing for hours.

18
00:01:53.478 --> 00:01:56.865
Is that a hump on your back?

19
00:01:56.865 --> 00:02:02.839
No. That's my back fin.

20
00:02:02.839 --> 00:02:10.084
It's small and looks like a hump.

21
00:02:10.084 --> 00:02:13.241
You have a big tail!

22
00:02:13.241 --> 00:02:17.952
Our tails help us jump out of the water.

23
00:02:17.952 --> 00:02:24.337
Humpback whales love to splash.

24
00:02:24.337 --> 00:02:34.529
Watch this. Splash!

25
00:02:34.529 --> 00:02:37.825
Good-bye!

26
00:02:37.826 --> 00:02:43.466
Good-bye, Humpback Whale!
